          "kind": "informational",
          "level": "none",
          "guid": "mtqo7rk91xb9lvy2",
          "message": {
            "text": "Pinned-context text must render before the generation-global font and glyph snapshots are collected. The embedded-font renderer assigns PUA codepoints while rendering; taking the snapshot first produced valid-looking text references whose late codepoints were absent from the emitted subset cmap. The browser regression verifies cmap coverage for every emitted text character.",
            "markdown": "Pinned-context text must render before the generation-global font and glyph snapshots are collected. The embedded-font renderer assigns PUA codepoints while rendering; taking the snapshot first produced valid-looking text references whose late codepoints were absent from the emitted subset cmap. The browser regression verifies cmap coverage for every emitted text character."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/scroll/composer.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 720,
                  "endLine": 743,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  // Render the pinned page context before taking the generation-global font /\n  // glyph snapshots. Its text can add PUA glyphs to the same subset registries\n  // as the moving owner captures; collecting first would leave those late\n  // glyph references absent from the emitted embedded fonts.\n  const staticMarkup = staticUnderlay == null\n    ? \"\"\n    : `\\n    <g data-scroll-static-context=\"true\"><svg x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"${W}\" height=\"${VH}\" viewBox=\"0 0 ${W} ${VH}\">` +\n        elementTreeToSvgInner(staticUnderlay, W, VH, \"static-\", false, hiDPIFactor, false) +\n      `</svg></g>`;\n\n  // DM-652: collect every `@font-face` rule the embedded-font path\n  // registered during segment + overlay rendering above, into a single\n  // top-level <style> block. Each font appears once (registry is keyed\n  // per (family, weight, italic)) — segments referencing the same font\n  // collapse onto one rule. Restore the default render mode now that\n  // all per-segment rendering has finished.\n  const fontFaceCss = getEmbeddedFontFaceCss();\n  // Paths-mode definitions are generation-global for the same reason. Segment,\n  // fixed, and sticky renders deliberately omit their local copies above; emit\n  // the complete registry once in this document's outer defs. Besides reducing\n  // payload, this makes every id unique before the scroll document is nested in\n  // an animate frame (Blink resolves local SVG IRIs through the shared TreeScope,\n  // not through the nearest nested <svg> element).\n  const glyphDefs = getGlyphDefs();"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
